# {{PROJECT_NAME_PASCAL}}

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 20+ / Python 3.11+
- pnpm / uv

### Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/{{AUTHOR}}/{{PROJECT_NAME}}.git
cd {{PROJECT_NAME}}

# Install dependencies
pnpm install  # or: uv sync
```

### Development

```bash
# Start development server
pnpm dev  # or: uv run python -m {{PROJECT_NAME_SNAKE}}
```

### Building

```bash
pnpm build  # or: uv build
```

### Testing

```bash
pnpm test  # or: uv run pytest
```

